  questId: egg
  recipe: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f15ee6b496904bd4a8b19ad6282c7a14, type: 2}
  prerequisites:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d66065f52e9d6a49beeb4d4034eed49, type: 2}
  lockedText: Let's see that bacon first.
  offerText: Yes please, just egg on a plate that should be enough.
  reminderText: Is there really anything better than a crispy fried egg with a runny
    yolk on a freezing day? I guess there probably is... I just can't think of a
    single thing right now.
  exactText: It really does taste better than any other day, doesn't it? I wonder
    why... Why did it never taste this good before?
  extraText: You know what came before the chicken or the egg? It's the fact that
    neither of them existed, and there was never any meaning to convey in the first
    place.
